# --- Secrets — NEVER commit --------------------------------------------------
.env
*.env
!.env.example


.claude/*
# The five reference docs CLAUDE.md routes every session to (SKILLS.md/DESIGN.md were already
# tracked as pre-existing files, which git keeps tracking regardless of a later ignore rule --
# these three were created after the blanket rule above and so were silently never committed by
# any of tasks 1-6 of the LLM Mentions feature, despite real content having been written into
# them the whole time. `.claude/*` (not `.claude/`) so the negations below can reach inside the
# directory -- a bare directory-level ignore stops git from descending into it at all, which
# silently defeats file-level `!` exceptions.
!.claude/api-reference.md
!.claude/features.md
!.claude/tech-stack.md

# Google OAuth token artifacts
token.json
credentials.json
google_token.pickle

